WEBVTT

00:05:59.439 --> 00:06:01.176
katika tafiti 400

00:06:01.176 --> 00:06:03.305
inaitwa fikra ya usimamizi wa uoga,

00:06:03.305 --> 00:06:05.655
na wazo ni rahisi.Ni hivi.

00:06:05.655 --> 00:06:08.204
Tunakuza mawazo yetu kuhusu dunia,

00:06:08.204 --> 00:06:10.361
hivyo,hadithi tunazoambia nafsi zetu

00:06:10.361 --> 00:06:13.097
kuhusu dunia na sehemu yetu

00:06:13.097 --> 00:06:15.379
ili kusaidia kusimamia

00:06:15.379 --> 00:06:18.293
hofu ya kifo.

00:06:18.293 --> 00:06:20.092
Na hizi hadithi za kifo

00:06:20.092 --> 00:06:23.089
zina maelfu ya shuhuda tofauti tofauti,

00:06:23.089 --> 00:06:26.673
lakini naamini nyuma ya utofauti uliopo

00:06:26.673 --> 00:06:29.372
kuna aina nne za muhimu

00:06:29.372 --> 00:06:32.883
ambazo hizi hadithi za vifo zinahusiana.